name mleftright
category Package
revision 79461
shortdesc Variants of delimiters that act as maths open/close
relocated 1
longdesc The package defines variants \mleft and \mright of \left and
longdesc \right, that make the delimiters act as \mathopen and
longdesc \mathclose. These commands address spacing difficulties in
longdesc subformulas.
runfiles size=2
 RELOC/tex/generic/mleftright/mleftright.sty
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/LaTeX-Package-Repositories/mleftright/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/LaTeX-Package-Repositories/mleftright
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/mleftright
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics maths tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 1.2
